       ":LOGBOOK:\n"
       "CLOCK: \\[2026-01-01 [A-Za-z]\\{2,3\\} 10:59\\]\n"
       ":END:\n"
       "\\'"))
    ("above it in the same drawer"
     ,(concat
       "* TODO Task One\n"
       ":LOGBOOK:\n"
