       "CLOCK: \\[2026-01-01 [A-Za-z]\\{2,3\\} 10:59\\]\n"
       ":END:\n"
       "\\'")))
  "A clock-out at 10:59 beside one a year ahead, and where that one sits.
Each entry is (DESCRIPTION CONTENT OTHER-CONTENT EXPECTED-REGEX), as
