(defmacro org-records-mcp-test--with-view-catalogue (catalogue &rest body)
  "Run BODY as `org-records-mcp-test--with-views' does, CATALOGUE writing the views.
CATALOGUE is the value of `org-records-mcp-view-catalogue-function'."
