   ":PROPERTIES:\n"
   ":ID:       " org-records-mcp-test--node-shape-file-id "\n"
   ":END:\n"
   "* Only\n")
  "A file whose own property drawer carries an ID and which sets no title.")

(ert-deftest org-records-mcp-test-node-shape-file-linked-by-its-id ()
  "A file carrying an ID of its own reports that ID as its link.
Reading the path and reading the ID return the same node, so a file is
addressed the way every other node is.  Setting no `#+TITLE:' leaves
the file's own name as its title."
  (org-records-mcp-test--with-id-setup test-file org-records-mcp-test--content-file-node-id
      (list org-records-mcp-test--node-shape-file-id)
    (let* ((link (concat "id:" org-records-mcp-test--node-shape-file-id))
