   "\\*\\* First child\n"
   "\\*\\* TODO Target\n"
   org-records-mcp-test--verbs-target-drawers-refile-logged
   "\\*\\*\\* Child\n"
   "\\*\\*\\*\\* Grandchild\n"
   "\\*\\* Second child\n"
   "\\'")
  "The same file as `org-records-mcp-test--verbs-target-refiled', refile logged.
The move is the one that file records; the only difference is the
